## Proving your work

When you claim something is "fixed" or "done":
- Record a measurement: `ibis ledger <node> <value> "<what you measured>"`
- Update the node's todo= attribute in GRAPH.dot
- Update PRIORITIES.md if this closes a priority item
- Update the doc= file if the system state changed
